  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). Pattern: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{跨|また}がる.\n\nUSAGE:\nSense 1 takes the particle ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ to mark what is being straddled. Sense 2 also uses ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ to mark the range or boundary being spanned. Both senses share the core meaning of extending across something.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{馬|うま}→馬：01865_uma⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{跨|また}がる (to mount a horse)\n- ⟦{自転車|じてんしゃ}→自転車：00633_jitensha⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{跨|また}がる (to get on a bicycle)\n- ⟦{国境|こっきょう}→国境：02762_kokkyou⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{跨|また}がる (to span a national border)\n- ⟦{複数|ふくすう}→複数：14236_fukusuu⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{分野|ぶんや}→分野：03612_bunya⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{跨|また}がる (to span multiple fields)",
